---
// src/components/MemoryGrid.astro
---

<div class="grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 my-6">
  {/* 1. Session Memory Card */}
  <div
    class="flex flex-col p-5 rounded-2xl border border-red-900/40 bg-red-950/20 shadow-sm"
  >
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
      <span class="flex h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-red-400 animate-pulse"></span>
      <h4 class="text-xs font-mono font-black uppercase tracking-wider text-red-400">
        Session Memory (휘발성 컨텍스트)
      </h4>
    </div>
    <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
      세션 종료시 사라질 수 있으며, 대화가 길어질수록 과거의 결정 사항을 잊고 환각이 발생합니다.
    </p>

    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
      {
        ['현재 채팅 세션', 'Context Window', 'Agent Runtime'].map(
          (item) => (
            <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-bold bg-slate-900 text-slate-300 border border-slate-800 rounded-lg shadow-sm">
              {item}
            </span>
          )
        )
      }
    </div>
  </div>

  {/* 2. Project Memory Card */}
  <div
    class="flex flex-col p-5 rounded-2xl border border-emerald-500/40 bg-emerald-950/20 shadow-md"
  >
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
      <span class="flex h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400"></span>
      <h4 class="text-xs font-mono font-black uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-400">
        Project Memory (영구 자산)
      </h4>
    </div>
    <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
      Git과 마크다운 표준 문서로 영구 보존되어 세션이 끝나도 어떤 모델이든 개발을 이어갑니다.
    </p>

    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
      {
        [
          'Git Commit',
          'PRODUCT_SPEC.md',
          'ARCHITECTURE.md',
          'TASKS.md',
          '공통 문서: AGENTS.md',
        ].map((item) => (
          <span
            class={`inline-block px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-bold rounded-lg border ${
              item.endsWith('.md')
                ? 'bg-slate-950 text-cyan-300 border-slate-800 font-mono'
                : 'bg-emerald-950 text-emerald-300 border-emerald-800/80'
            } shadow-sm`}
          >
            {item}
          </span>
        ))
      }
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
